Z||000000||AusFiero||05-11-2001||01:10 PM||||Well here is a front view of the body kit. I will let the pictures do most of the talking.<P>Pricing is getting close as I am haggling with a few manufacturers and shipping companies to get the best possible rate.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2frontunpainted.jpg"> <BR>This is the bolted up and unpainted version.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2frontpainted.jpg"> <BR>Painted and ready for the road.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2-1frontunpainted.jpg"> <BR>Unpainted with an option people will probably want. A bolt in front grill section. You will have to cut a section out of the lower part of your GT Fascia to work.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2-1frontpainted.jpg"> <BR>Painted again and looking even better (I think so anyway)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2frontpaintgold.jpg"> <BR>And painted gold jsut for the heck of it.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero.gif"> <BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||6
