Z||000009||FieroGTguy||05-12-2001||11:34 PM||||Yeah, see what kind of openings you can mesh for the rear bumper.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I'm going to have a meshed hood scoop, meshed front bumper, meshed rocker scoops, meshed quarter window scoops, meshed decklid scoop, now I need something cool for the rear bumper.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">  Need to cool those exhaust pipes.  heh<P>THX<P>Greg||||reg||1
Z||000010||Spektyr||05-13-2001||03:05 PM||||The only thing I don't like is the grill insert.  It looks like a Dodge.  The Pontiac hexagonal mesh grill looks great IMHO.<P>More fighter-plane-ish?  The Fiero's already shaped like a bullet, something to make it look mean, hungry... like it'll eat the car in front of it if they don't move outta the way...<P>(course it's easy for one make suggestions when one can't do artwork to save one's life.  And I can't.)||||reg||1
